30 cases, identical passages, 2 runs per setting

  effort       correct  output tok  reasoning    p50    p95
  none     20 / 21 /30          588          0   0.8s   1.1s
  low      21 / 19 /30        2,304      1,594   1.0s   2.6s
  medium   20 / 22 /30        4,517      3,829   1.0s   3.3s
  high     20 / 18 /30        8,124      7,373   1.2s   6.3s

From 'none' to 'high', output tokens went from 588 to 8,124 a run and the
median call from 0.8s to 1.2s. Scores ranged from 18 to 22 across every setting and run,
and the same setting moved by up to 2 between its two runs — so on these
questions, read the score column for any difference larger than that, and only then
pay for more thinking.
